# Choice dialogues of the storyline payoff scenes, second batch (T-143). Compiled to zz_fs_storyline_scenes2.json.

dialogue story.band.talk
n0 piper: Exhibit A: a fiddle, a voice, a lifetime of practice. Watch.
  next n1
n1 juno: Exhibit B: three anvils, a wash bucket and Bram, who has agreed to hit one thing. Once.
  next n2
n2 bram: Hm.
  next n3
n3 piper: Well? Who owns the square tonight?
  ? The fiddle. => r0 | flag:choice.band.piper
  ? The forge band. => r1 | flag:choice.band.juno
  ? Both, together. => r2 | flag:choice.band.both | friend:piper,10 | friend:juno,10
r0 piper: Ha! Justice and good taste. Bow, everybody.
  expr happy
r1 juno: Okay, okay, okay! Did you hear that, Bram? We won. Bram?
  expr happy
r2 piper: Together? ...That's either genius or a noise complaint. Let's find out.
  emote note

dialogue story.pumpkin.dorian
n0 -: You find Dorian behind the store, with a very large pumpkin and a very guilty face.
  next n1
n1 tilda: Is that my prize pumpkin? The one the whole village has been blaming the goats for?
  next n2
n2 dorian: ...It might be.
  ? Let them off kindly. => r0 | flag:choice.pumpkin.dorian.kind | friend:dorian,10
  ? Insist on a proper apology. => r1 | flag:choice.pumpkin.dorian.apology
  ? Offer to help carry it back. => r2 | flag:choice.pumpkin.dorian.help | friend:tilda,10
r0 tilda: Kindly? Fine. Kindly. But he's on the slate for a pie.
  expr thinking
r1 dorian: An apology. Yes. Very sorry. Truly. Pumpkin, I'm also sorry to you.
  emote sweat
r2 tilda: You carry the heavy end. I'll supervise. We'll call it civic duty.
  expr happy

