dialogue story.cat.talk
n0 -: A small gray cat sits on your boots, perfectly satisfied, and looks up at you with the patience of a landlord.
  next n1
n1 wren: Tilda calls it Ledger. Juno says Quench. Piper swears it's Sharp. Hazel files it under Index. I say Gossip. The cat answers to none of us.
  next n2
n2 wren: So. What do you call it?
  ? Ledger. => r0 | flag:choice.cat.ledger
  ? Quench. => r1 | flag:choice.cat.quench
  ? Sharp. => r2 | flag:choice.cat.sharp
  ? Something new. => r3 | flag:choice.cat.new | friend:wren,10
r0 wren: Tilda's name. Careful. She keeps a very long slate.
r1 wren: Juno's name. Brave. She'll label the cat's bowl.
r2 wren: Piper's name. A fiddler's cat. It suits the whiskers.
r3 wren: Something new! The cat tilts its head. ...It just purred. That's the one.
  expr happy
  emote heart
